<title>POLAND: Polish yr/yr PPI 11.2 pct in Jan vs 10.5 Dec.</title>
<headline>Polish yr/yr PPI 11.2 pct in Jan vs 10.5 Dec.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish producer prices rose 1.9 percent in January against a 0.5 percent rise in December, taking year-on-year producer price inflation up to 11.2 percent, the Central Statistical Office (GUS) said.  </p>
<p> POLISH PRODUCER INFLATION	  JANUARY   DECEMBER   JAN 1996</p>
<p> month/month change (pct)		1.9	 0.5	  1.8</p>
<p> yr/yr change (pct)		     11.2	10.5	 15.0</p>
<p>  manufacturing m/m change	     0.8	 0.5	  1.1</p>
<p>  manufacturing yr/yr change	   9.9	 9.9	 14.5</p>
<p>  mining m/m change			2.8	 1.1	  3.2</p>
<p>  mining yr/yr change		   15.6	10.6	 15.2</p>
<p>  utilities m/m change		   7.9	 0.1	  5.1</p>
<p>  utilities yr/yr change		14.5	11.9	 17.3</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
